usage: run_surface_release.py [-h] (--demo | --surface SURFACE)
                              [--config CONFIG] [--subdivisions SUBDIVISIONS]
                              [--boundary-proxy-reference BOUNDARY_PROXY_REFERENCE]
                              [--current-uniformity-reference CURRENT_UNIFORMITY_REFERENCE]
                              [--output-dir OUTPUT_DIR] [--plot]

Convert a validated surface-temperature history to conservative release. Run
--demo for explicitly manufactured heating and binding parameters, or supply
--surface and --config together for an externally prepared history. This
workflow invokes no gap, Boltzmann, CR or FLASH executable.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --demo
  --surface SURFACE
  --config CONFIG
  --subdivisions SUBDIVISIONS
  --boundary-proxy-reference BOUNDARY_PROXY_REFERENCE
                        Explicit evidence reference for approximating boundary
                        T with a material-plane sample
  --current-uniformity-reference CURRENT_UNIFORMITY_REFERENCE
                        Explicit evidence reference for applying a current-
                        averaged T to a nonlinear source
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
  --plot
